{"id":"7046791115d871d9","group":"16","path":"16/16-thm-omega-sets-embedding.md","title":"历史入口","display":"thm-omega-sets-embedding — 历史入口","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","chapter":"1","label":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding","aliases":["16-thm-omega-sets-embedding","16-thm--omega-sets-embedding"],"display":"thm-omega-sets-embedding — 历史入口","depends_on":["[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]"],"source":"Proposition 6.2.3, pp. 386–387 (PDF 406–407)","revision_date":"2026-10-07"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"label","html":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-thm-omega-sets-embedding</span><span>16-thm--omega-sets-embedding</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-omega-sets-embedding — 历史入口"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Proposition 6.2.3, pp. 386–387 (PDF 406–407)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-07"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}\">\\(F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\">\\(s:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" href=\"?note=198e3b21cd4c6cd2\" title=\"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff\">16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff</a> 的公式。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span> 为任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\">\\(\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\)</span> 对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\dashv F,\\qquad\n\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}(X,Y)\\cong\\mathbf{Eff}(FX,FY).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\dashv F,\\qquad\n\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}(X,Y)\\cong\\mathbf{Eff}(FX,FY).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>对象、箭头、实现集合与自然双射的证明见规范原子；满忠实函子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是该反射的右伴随。</li>\n<li>来源：Jacobs, <em>Categorical Logic and Type Theory</em>，Proposition 6.2.3, pp. 386–387 (PDF 406–407)。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"198e3b21cd4c6cd2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 与 $s:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}$ 采用 [[16-thm-omega-sets-embedding-eff]] 的公式。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"F:\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"s:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}","display":false},{"tex":"s\\dashv F,\\qquad\n\\omega\\mathbf{Sets}(X,Y)\\cong\\mathbf{Eff}(FX,FY).","display":true},{"tex":"F","display":false}],"bytes":989,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-436","locations":["正文"],"